Package: buddydrive
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, libsodium23, libsqlite3-0, liblz4-1, libgtk-4-1
Description: P2P encrypted folder backup with buddies
 BuddyDrive is a peer-to-peer encrypted folder backup tool. It backs
 folders up to 1-2 friends across the internet, bypassing NATs and
 firewalls using libp2p, and keeps them encrypted at the buddy's end.
 .
 Features:
  - P2P networking with relay-API discovery and relay fallback
  - Encrypted backup using libsodium (XSalsa20-Poly1305)
  - Per-buddy storage with per-folder encryption
  - 12-word recovery phrase and relay-backed config restore
  - SQLite-based file index
  - systemd service support
  - GTK4 graphical interface and an embedded web GUI
